3. **Minimal Empirical Spike Protocol**: Define a Jacobian sensitivity test measuring $\|\partial F / \partial a_t\|_2$ vs $\|\partial F / \partial p_{\mathrm{future}}\|_2$ before and after causal sanitization of Groups 18–21.

