+**Author:** Primary Author B. **Status:** proposal; all necessity claims are Candidate. **Packet:** B01. **Method:** v1.0, `1ce8d1b3e42cfbec2122468c595d52d238d6ca1dfd079292b7d61d95fb3d11f7`.
